[~accountid:6242fffc1da0e10071388193]  including you in on this comment as you wanted an overview of the clauses in the branding agreement to ensure there was mandatory obligations on the driver. 

+*Agreement between Drovo and the Driver*+

*Clause 4.3* of the agreement states {color:#ff991f}_“We will use our best efforts to match you to Branding for you to provide the Advertising Services, but are under no obligation to do so and_ {color}{color:#ff991f}+*_you are under no obligation_*+ {color}{color:#ff991f}_to accept the Advertisements”_ {color}- therefore the driver is under no obligation to have branding on their vehicle. The driver has the free will to decide if they want the branding on their vehicle to essentially make some “extra cash”.

*Clause 5.1* states {color:#ff991f}_“During the Term, Drovo may switch the Driver_ {color}{color:#ff991f}+*_into different campaigns with different Brands_*+{color}{color:#ff991f}_, including carrying Drovo-specific branding or third party client campaigns. In this case, we will request that you bring in the Vehicle for it to be re-wrapped with updated branding”_ {color}- The driver will not solely have Bolt branding on their vehicle, therefore the branding is not exclusive to Bolt only as the vehicle will have Drovos advertising and potentially other brands. 

*Clause 5.2* {color:#ff991f}_“When not carrying Advertisements from a specific Advertiser campaign, Drovo will ensure that your Vehicle is branded with the Drovo brand. Drovo expects between 2 to 5 campaigns per any 12 month period, but that is not a set limitation”_{color}

*Clause 6.2* {color:#ff991f}_“In the eventuality that the Advertisements represent content such as, gambling or alcohol,_ {color}{color:#ff991f}*_t_*{color}{color:#ff991f}+*_he driver reserves the right to refuse such wrapping_*+{color}{color:#ff991f} _on the basis of religious affiliation”_{color}

The obligations on the driver in the agreement are listed at clause 7 and state:

# *Your Obligations*

You shall:

7.1 maintain valid insurance, MOT and road tax on your Vehicle (or ensure that the Vehicle’s owner is maintaining such documentation), comply with all road traffic laws and regulations and ensure that the Vehicle is legal in all other respects including legally parked during the Term;

7.2 act at all times during the Term in the best interests of us and the Advertiser, and to not act in any way that may cause us, the Advertiser or the Brand to be brought into disrepute;

7.3 not advertise any other campaign, individual, business or organisation on your Vehicle during the Term, without our express written consent;

7.4 ensure that all information that you submit to us will be accurate in all material aspects. If we determine in our sole discretion that such information is false, incorrect or misleading we may terminate the Agreement with immediate effect. You shall notify us as soon as possible (but in any event within one week) should the information you have provided to us need updating, by emailing us at [+help@adverttu.com+|mailto:help@adverttu.com];

7.5 use best efforts to park your Vehicle so that the Advertisements are fully visible, or are as visible as possible in the circumstances. You shall try and avoid parking the Vehicle in off-street parking;

